      "summary_en": "Karma creates a tether between herself and a targeted enemy, dealing damage and revealing them. If the tether is not broken, the enemy will be rooted and damaged again. Mantra Bonus: Karma strengthens the link, healing herself and extending the root duration.",
      "summary_zh": "卡尔玛在她和目标敌人之间产生一条灵链，同时造成伤害，并使目标暴露。如果灵链在一段时间内没有被破坏，那么目标敌人就会被束缚在原地并再次受到伤害。 梵咒增效：卡尔玛强化灵链，治疗自身并延长禁锢时长。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": []
